		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0},\n{STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 4, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 5, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 6, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 8, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 9, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 12, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 13, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 14, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 15, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 16, 0}, and\f{STRVAR_1 0, 17, 0} are not allowed to enter.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0},\n{STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 4, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 5, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 6, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 8, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 9, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 12, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 13, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 14, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 15, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 16, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 17, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 18, 0}\fare not allowed to enter.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come holla at me when you ready.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the\nhomie {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the homies\n{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before\nI let you in. That cool?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right this way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Look who back!\rI gotta save the game before you\npick up where you left off. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo!\rYou ain’t save before you dipped\nlast time.\rSo that run is DONE. You\ndisqualified. Them the rules!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyy, congrats!\rFor that W, we givin’ you\nthis souvenir print!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Gold Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Silver Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SINGLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DOUBLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TAKE CHALLENGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One Hustler pick\n“BECOME LEADER.”\rThe other Hustler pick\n“JOIN GROUP.”{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We finna fire up DS Wireless\nCommunications.{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before I\nlet you in. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The game board is like your life.\rIt go round and round\nas your luck go up and down...\fHow that sound?\rIt almost made sense,\ndidn’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s some luck in\nscraps...\rThe Battle Arcade remind me of that,\nhard. VERY hard...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you need most here?\nStrength?\fBrains?\fLuck?\fNah. The answer is...bein’ flexible.\fThat’s what my gut tellin’ me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what I mean by\n“stop on the spot”?\rIt’s the skill of stoppin’ the\ngame board at the right time!\rBut, remember...\fIf you don’t stop it in 30 seconds,\nit stop by itself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I thought I was locked in with my\nbest homies, but I had to swap ’em\fand use the other guy’s instead!\fI gotta rethink my whole game plan.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I picked homies that hit hard.\fBut the other guy went for speed!\rNext time, I’mma run homies\nthat’s FAST.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Stop on the spot” skills\ngot advantages!\rBut there’s a lotta fun in lettin’\nluck decide... Like a scratch-off.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The game board show better options\nthe more you win...\rCould this board be ALIVE...?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You figure this one out?\rParalysis events here don’t\naffect Ground-type homies.\rTell everybody!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0110_D32R0601_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme tell you somethin’.\rPoison or freeze events can get\nshut down.\r...If the homie’s type or ability\nprotect it from that status.\rMight be worth knowin’!</language>
	</row>
</body>
